## Emergency contacts (debug recipes)

- **Build wedged in spinner**: `pgrep -f siso | xargs kill -CONT 2>/dev/null` (resume SIGSTOPed workers), or `pkill -f siso && ./scripts/chromium/build.sh` (clean restart).
- **Patch rebase conflict after pin bump**: apply patch → `git am --3way`, resolve hunks, `git add -u && git am --continue`, re-export patch via `format-patch`.
- **Missing `chromium/src/out/Default/SlayZone.app`**: run `./scripts/chromium/build.sh`. First build from scratch is ~3-4h.
- **Sidecar client retries forever**: normal in current state — sidecar daemon isn't auto-launched. Will be fixed when Phase 7.1 lands the dev-bootstrap helper.
- **GCM DEPRECATED_ENDPOINT errors on launch**: ignore — server is dead, nothing leaks. Small Phase 2 follow-up.
- **CDP /json/new returns "PUT only"**: use `httpRequest(path, "PUT")` not GET. Chromium 148 tightened this.
